            "review_title": "Review at Ben Coffee House",
            "review_text": "David D\nAdelaide, Australia889 contributions\n6\nVery Good Coffee but don’t touch the menu!\nNov 2019 • Solo\nI’ve been to this place a few years ago when I had a very good Vietnamese coffee with ice. This seems to be more a place for locals so the standard of coffee must be high. The floor manager has a mix of flamboyance and efficiency and will direct you to where to order and locate a good seat. BUT once you’re seated don’t dare touch where he’s placed the menus for the next customer. Everything in its place! And yes the coffee is still very good and it’s a nice place for people watching.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 22, 2019",
